if p:summary=f'<div class="grid"><div class="card"><strong>{p["torso_c"]:.2f}°C torso mean</strong><p>{p["neck_c"]:.2f}°C neck mean. Fixed air regions; volume/time averages.</p></div><div class="card"><strong>{p["active_motors"]} active motors</strong><p>{p["mass_g_s"]:.1f}g/s; {p["supply_c"]:.2f}°C calculated supply. Four installed remains the reference architecture.</p></div><div class="card"><strong>{p["combined_upward_error_budget_for20"]:.2f}K mean margin</strong><p>Combined upward-error allowance before20°C fails. This error bound is not established physically.</p></div></div><p>The occupied air region averages {p["occupied_c"]:.1f}°C. At the final output, {p["neck_fraction_below20"]*100:.0f}% of the neck sampling volume is below20°C. A mean target does not imply uniform cooling.</p>'
